{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方大块高亮白色正文，第一眼落在首行开头“他仍不服气”，字号、亮度和位置都明显占优；右上角目录和下方音符动画较弱。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"像是仍在为过去受的气耿耿于怀，具体处境不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不服气、憋屈；其他感受不确定。\",\n  \"missed\": \"如今已经不在那些人身边、对过去开心记忆的眷恋与失落，以及不服气逐渐消退、最后疲惫松弛的变化。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"单块太长，一块里有好几层意思\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "618aac46-60f7-48a8-9a03-6c9bb193d84c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T015441962515Z", "elapsed_seconds": 45.39, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:55:27.363983+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a758bd5cf85cfa643a84963511fda9bc7bbb77eca3341970d1361bfb1e95ab3c", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": 